{"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","verdict":"REPAIR","counterexamples":[],"corrections":[{"diagnostic_index":0,"artifact":"formalization.json","explanation":"Retain the negative capability report for O8 and every active frozen ID. The supplied registered language lacks a primitive binding a proposition to the actual proposed and kernel-reconstructed contract metadata, independent checking events before proof, after acceptance and at closure, and configured verification trust boundary. Records and lists can represent stipulated IDs, flags, facets and stage names, but scalar equality and folds cannot connect those values to the actual artifacts or checking events. Source requirements express the solve endpoint and seven source properties; primitive filters, maps and folds with an optional previous sum can express the functional aggregation, but neither represents O8's workflow requirements. The raw Lean alternative remains subject to the same executable DSL gates and supplies no such registered primitive. No faithful complete alternative is established from the supplied language; preserve the blocking report without claiming impossibility, a fix, source discharge or an implementation counterexample."}]}